---

This application bundles no map data, but it displays and routes over data
from third parties under their own licences:

- Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, Open Database License (ODbL).
- Places © Overture Maps Foundation, CDLA-Permissive-2.0 / ODbL.
- Vector tiles by OpenFreeMap; raster basemaps by CARTO, Esri, OpenTopoMap,
  CyclOSM and HOT OSM France under their respective terms.
- Routing by the FOSSGIS Valhalla instance; search by Photon (Komoot) and
  Nominatim; weather by Open-Meteo; photos via Wikimedia Commons.

`packages/vector_map_tiles` is a vendored copy of the vector_map_tiles package
(BSD-3-Clause, see its LICENSE file) with the modifications listed in
`packages/vector_map_tiles/PATCHES.md`.
